# /jupyter on: serve the JupyterLite build. Imported inside `handle @jupyter` of config/Caddyfile
# (ANTHIVE_JUPYTER_SNIPPET, the default). `/jupyter` without a slash is redirected first.
# COOP/COEP headers are required for SharedArrayBuffer (Pyodide kernel).
@jupyter_bare path /jupyter
redir @jupyter_bare /jupyter/ 301
header Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy "same-origin"
header Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy "require-corp"
file_server
